  "2026-10-20: User corrections: Burden V←Pursuer VII, Burden VI←Temenos VIII, Nietzschean IV not linked to Temenos IX.",
  "2026-10-20: Cycle IV/V portion added from the Tree of Knowledge p.72 scan. Ids: MC Midascore, DJ Demidjinn, DK Dahaka, BL Babelian Lunacy; Cycle V (not playable yet): OH Old Haunt, PH Dragon of Phobos, MK Meduketos, UF Ur-Fleece, TX Titan X. Old Haunt II-V give the Cycle IV tear (cycle:4). 'Old Haunt Unlocked' (campaign event) is not modelled. Cursed Mode checkbox not modelled.",
